Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Decision to Stay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 21
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In my lifetime, I’ve seen plenty of betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But Wolffy and Jay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,have been fiercely loyal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.61,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only have they repaired my car time and again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but this time, they even recovered my most prized weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,have you forgotten about the traitor Weslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They used to be companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I possibly be in cahoots with that little goat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.97,0:00:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I took three bottles of water from him—that’s all—in exchange for protecting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, am I about to be found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said. You show integrity as clients
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.29,0:01:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and loyalty as subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.57,0:01:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, everyone should look to them as role models.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us join hands to create a glorious future for Blue Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Create a glorious future for Blue Planet! Create a glorious future for Blue Planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Create a glorious future for Blue Planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the reward for this time—keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to tell Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster has appeared in this world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.77,0:01:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss’s flatbread is really delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you can have mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.77,0:01:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you going to eat, Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to leave; take good care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.93,0:01:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I never told you, but I’m actually not from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,With that stuffed-toy body of yours, it’s obvious you’re different from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.09,0:02:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I come from a place called Green Green Grassland
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A rift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A rift just like this one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, you wouldn’t understand anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I do understand; I’ve seen a rift like this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You…you’ve seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was cleaning the screws,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I happened to see a rift like this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,marked on the map in the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:03:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, let’s get out of here quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.85,0:03:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re done for if Boss catches us trespassing in the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The map…the map…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enter the password.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Boss knows these passwords.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get out of here before Boss finds us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.65,0:03:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in my cockpit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re just cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.61,0:03:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re done for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at what they’ve done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We can explain this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they take the initiative to find work
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.09,0:04:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and actively clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whereas you lot just eat and play; you show no initiative at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.65,0:04:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You really ought to learn from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just something we ought to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a mission now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The base is running low on water, so we need to fetch some from a nearby town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fetching water…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time there’s a mission, you’re the first to step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This time’s Outstanding Employees…I trust there’s no more dispute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss is brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, how do we get this water?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s simple: go to a nearby town and mention my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just take the water directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.34,0:04:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy. Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use this chance to slip out and meet Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And fill him in on the situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work. I’m going to reward you handsomely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.01,0:05:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, do you know that getting the water—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t talk about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.97,0:05:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My stomach hurts; I can’t hold it in anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.85,0:05:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that urgent?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to relieve myself; wait for me in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie was supposed to be waiting for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t attack; he’s a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, why are you with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.93,0:05:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.77,0:05:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s fine; I made a deal with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I help her find the antidote to heal her eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,she’ll lead us to the rift and escort Xiao Mei to where she wants to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:05:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she goes back on her word after she’s healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I want to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.89,0:06:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Pull them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.69,0:06:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like how you refused to give up on me back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter the outcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I will support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t leave just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I heard there’s a map inside Cha Erlang’s war chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.09,0:06:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows the location of the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang trusts me a lot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure I’ll be able to get the rift map and the antidote soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.29,0:06:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t—don’t hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.61,0:06:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you didn’t bring any toilet paper, so I came to bring you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Jay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, he’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,…one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right, right. I’m on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t say a word. I promise to keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re off to fetch some water now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll find a way to contact you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.05,0:07:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, fetching water is really dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should go back and get some backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s dangerous about it? I’ve weathered all kinds of storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call. So, “fetching water” actually means fighting for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you tell me sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you’d seen all kinds of storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you had some kind of ace up your sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, why can’t we just be like everyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:08:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and trade normally with the water station?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is nothing but purple sand, with only a few oases.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And they’re all controlled by different warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,These warlords control different resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Some towns are focused on entertainment, while others produce resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But the vital water supply is held by a major warlord named Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But Boss and the Lords are sworn enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss asked why the Lords should have a monopoly on all those resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He absolutely refuses to engage in unfair deals with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why we have to seize whatever supplies we need by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, didn’t Boss send people to capture Xiao Mei earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.53,0:08:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If he’s at odds with the Lords, why did he take the bounty to catch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.73,0:08:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Boss wants to use Xiao Mei as leverage to negotiate with the Lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to trade her for a territory with water resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.41,0:08:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So that we, his subordinates, can have water to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Lords definitely won’t agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Boss is bound to clash with those Lords sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected that—you usually look so dazed, but it turns out you’re a walking encyclopedia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My benefactor said that people ought to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I’ve always been working hard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.09,0:09:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to become Cha Erlang’s right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.77,0:09:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your benefactor was right; keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the purple desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, we’re here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That is an unknown world; you must be extremely careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll let you know if there’s any news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so hot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there; we’ll find them soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think—if we rescue Weslie and Wolffy this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,we’ll become the main characters too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.65,0:10:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Daring to trespass on the Lord’s territory…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lord’s territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize them at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait—what if we refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are the people in this world so impulsive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Our food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.89,0:10:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We accidentally dropped our backpacks into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:11:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter; we can still do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.97,0:11:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you what the protagonist is capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.41,0:11:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out this invention Mr. Slowy gave me: the Daydream Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, your gear is impressive too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do more of them keep appearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.37,0:11:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid; I’m here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you’re the ones causing trouble in my territory.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
